# S-044: audio input registration. Identity is (mix, callback, param); the same pair on another mix is a different
# input; duplicates return false; mix index must be < 6. conversion == NULL -> output format; UNKNOWN/0 fields are
# replaced by the output's values; a resampler (fake, logged) is created only when format, rate or layout differ.
aopen main 48000 FLOAT_PLANAR STEREO
aconnect a 1 0
aconnect a 1 0
aconnect a 1 1
aconnect a 2 0
aconnect b 1 0
aconnect a 1 6
aconnect a 1 99
aconnect_null
ainfo
adump
# partial conversion info: unknown fields fall back to the output
aconnect a 10 2 - - - 0
aconnect a 11 2 44100 - - 0
aconnect a 12 2 - 16BIT_PLANAR - 1
aconnect a 13 2 - - MONO 0
aconnect a 14 2 48000 FLOAT_PLANAR STEREO 1
adump
# disconnect: unknown pair / wrong mix / out-of-range mix are ignored; order of the rest is preserved
adisconnect a 99 0
adisconnect a 1 5
adisconnect a 1 6
adisconnect a 2 0
adump
adisconnect a 1 0
adisconnect a 1 1
adump
ainfo
aclose
